2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e62e8ce98370397cda46c3c5ab3b211 2x, https://si.imgix.net/53a67d50/uploads/origins/176391ac-85b3-4f33-bf3c-cc02a27cfacb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6026fc019df4bfc7af8479973435f440 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "お世話になっております！オープンのお知らせを見たので依頼させていただきます！\nちびとらちゃんが太ってしまっていろんなことで困ってそうなイラストをお願いしたいです！\n\n例\n・太って幅感覚が狂ってコンソールテーブルにぶつかる。　\n・ドア枠にはまる。　\n・一階分階段を登っただけで疲労困憊\n・重さに耐えきれず壊れるイス\netc…\n例の中で書いてもらってもいいですしその他のシチュでも問題ありません！\n好きに描いてもらえると嬉しいです〜！\n\nhttps://x.com/minam_island/status/1798262460233007349?s=46", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SolphMidd/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/adf0d2e4/uploads/origins/1faf7c68-2a98-4783-9065-8cab02c3e63f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eeb09b31854cde25516d14ba30921ced", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/adf0d2e4/uploads/origins/1faf7c68-2a98-4783-9065-8cab02c3e63f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eeb09b31854cde25516d14ba30921ced, https://si.imgix.net/adf0d2e4/uploads/origins/1faf7c68-2a98-4783-9065-8cab02c3e63f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e60eba29e97ecc1ea76134dc9303730 2x, https://si.imgix.net/adf0d2e4/uploads/origins/1faf7c68-2a98-4783-9065-8cab02c3e63f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a58452396301d3662de08759d41123b3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I am very interested in a piece of my new green dog character with a very large body! \nI love to see when your characters stomachs grow so big their shirts can not contain them! \n\nIt would be very cute if it appears he has just noticed how fat he has become while he’s still eating something like a donut, his other hand resting on his belly!\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nMany references have been included, please draw him as large as you like!\n\